; The one variable: `layout_direction = 3` (RTL) on the lower CheckButton. Under RTL it draws the
; separate `toggle_on_mirrored` icon (check_button.cpp:109-120) at the left content margin (:135).
; Both rows are pressed, so a missed swap cannot hide behind a moved icon. unit-check-button is LTR.

